					<description><![CDATA[This is the whole producing line for making filter bag, any questions please send us email directly!
Experienced workers can make 1000 pcs standard filter bags 8 hours a day!

<a href="http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Philite-machinery-catalogue.pdf">We have the new whole machine catalogue,please click here!</a>]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<h2>Why choose us</h2>
<p>Philite’s initially specialized in designing and manufacturing of sewing machine. We have rich experience and sophisticated technology system in the design and production of the sewing machine.<br />
Complying with the huge demand of environmental protection industry for air filtration media, since 2009, the company has been committing to the design of automatic filter tube production line. After five years of continuous improvement, so far it has developed to the THIRD GENERATION of molding equipment and technically reaching maturity. Now we have been far ahead and reached the international advanced level.<br />
In order to fullfill complete solution to filter bag making, our company introduce, develop and upgrade various machine models. With mature technology and good after-sales service, our products are exported to Europe, South American, Africa market and etc..</p>
<h2>Pre-processing machinery</h2>
<p>During these processing , the <a href="https://filter.philitee.com/?product=roll-slitting-machine-for-filter-fabric">slitter rewinder fabric roll</a> cut the whole yardage roll and then the finished roll send to <a href="https://filter.philitee.com/?product=automatic-sewing-machines-for-filter-bags-2">Automatic sewing line</a> to produce semi-finished filter bag.Meanwhile , if you have more workers , you can also make the <a href="https://filter.philitee.com/?product=snap-band-cutting-machine">snap band</a> ,<a href="https://filter.philitee.com/?product=bottom-disc-punching-machine-for-making-filter-bag"> punched disc</a> and  <a href="https://filter.philitee.com/?product=fabric-strip-slitting-machine">fabric strip slitting</a> at the same time. This can greatly improve work efficiency.</p>
<p><img fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" class="alignnone size-medium wp-image-3603" src="https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Pre-processing-Machinery-768x851-detail1_syy-271x300.jpg" alt="" width="271" height="300" srcset="https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Pre-processing-Machinery-768x851-detail1_syy-271x300.jpg 271w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Pre-processing-Machinery-768x851-detail1_syy-600x665.jpg 600w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Pre-processing-Machinery-768x851-detail1_syy.jpg 768w" sizes="(max-width: 271px) 100vw, 271px" /></p>
<h2><span lang="EN-US">Post-processing machinery</span></h2>
<p>During these processing, we need 4 machines(<a href="https://filter.philitee.com/?product=long-arm-double-needle-sewing-machine-for-filter-bag">long arm sewing machine with double needle</a>,<a href="https://filter.philitee.com/?product=short-arm-double-needle-sewing-machine">short arm sewing machine with single/double needle</a>,<a href="https://filter.philitee.com/?product=two-needle-flat-bed-sewing-machine">flat table sewing machine with double needle</a>,<a href="https://filter.philitee.com/?product=feed-off-the-arm-three-needle-sewing-machine">feed-off-the arm sewing machine</a>) to sew the filter bag which have already produced by the pre-processing.<br />
These kinds of  machine can be suitable for different shapes of filter bags.</p>
<p><img decoding="async" class="alignnone size-medium wp-image-3605" src="https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Whole-Sewing-Machine-Product-Line-for-Producing-Filter-Bag-detail2_syy-300x300.jpg" alt="" width="300" height="300" srcset="https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Whole-Sewing-Machine-Product-Line-for-Producing-Filter-Bag-detail2_syy-300x300.jpg 300w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Whole-Sewing-Machine-Product-Line-for-Producing-Filter-Bag-detail2_syy-150x150.jpg 150w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Whole-Sewing-Machine-Product-Line-for-Producing-Filter-Bag-detail2_syy-100x100.jpg 100w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Whole-Sewing-Machine-Product-Line-for-Producing-Filter-Bag-detail2_syy.jpg 473w" sizes="(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px" /></p>
<h2>Notice</h2>
<p>If you do not need sew the filter bag, you also can choose the <a href="https://filter.philitee.com/?product=hot-welding-machine-for-filter-bag">welding machine</a> , which can joint without any needle.</p>
<p><img decoding="async" class="alignnone size-medium wp-image-3606" src="https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Hot-Welding-Machine-scaled-570x760-detail3_syy-225x300.jpg" alt="" width="225" height="300" srcset="https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Hot-Welding-Machine-scaled-570x760-detail3_syy-225x300.jpg 225w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Hot-Welding-Machine-scaled-570x760-detail3_syy.jpg 570w" sizes="(max-width: 225px) 100vw, 225px" /></p>
<h2>Liquid filter bag</h2>
<p>However , we also have 2 kinds of machines for sewing water filter bag, they are <a href="https://filter.philitee.com/?product=ultrasonic-hot-welding-machine">ultrasonic welding machine</a> and <a href="https://filter.philitee.com/?product=overlock-sewing-machine">overlock sewing machine.</a></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-3607" src="https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Polypropylene-Ultrasonic-Welding-Machine-_副本-570x570-1-300x300-detail4_syy.jpg" alt="" width="300" height="300" srcset="https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Polypropylene-Ultrasonic-Welding-Machine-_副本-570x570-1-300x300-detail4_syy.jpg 300w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Polypropylene-Ultrasonic-Welding-Machine-_副本-570x570-1-300x300-detail4_syy-150x150.jpg 150w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Polypropylene-Ultrasonic-Welding-Machine-_副本-570x570-1-300x300-detail4_syy-100x100.jpg 100w" sizes="(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-3608" src="https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Overlock-sewing-machine-2_副本_副本-570x570-1-300x300-detail5_syy.jpg" alt="" width="300" height="300" srcset="https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Overlock-sewing-machine-2_副本_副本-570x570-1-300x300-detail5_syy.jpg 300w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Overlock-sewing-machine-2_副本_副本-570x570-1-300x300-detail5_syy-150x150.jpg 150w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Overlock-sewing-machine-2_副本_副本-570x570-1-300x300-detail5_syy-100x100.jpg 100w" sizes="(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px" /></p>
]]></content:encoded>
					
